        "engine": "claude",
        "model": "",
        "prompt": "Generate accounting vouchers from approved invoice data: determine debit and credit accounts, calculate input VAT, and generate journal entries. Match the purchase order and goods receipt to ensure three-way matching. Produce accounting vouchers and accounts payable details.",
